OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMonday will be a generally dry
OL,6,Fday across the region with bright or
OL,7,Fsunny spells. Some more prolonged
OL,8,Fsunshine is possible later. Becoming
OL,9,Fvery warm in lighter winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRemaining dry overnight with
OL,12,Flengthy clear spells for many, however
OL,13,Fvariable amounts of cloud will feed in
OL,14,Facross western counties of the region.
OL,15,
OL,16,CTuesday:FDry with settled conditions
OL,17,Facross the region. Any early morning
OL,18,Fcloud will lift leaving behind plenty
OL,19,Fof late July sunshine. Feeling
OL,20,Fincreasingly very warm and locally hot
OL,21,Fin places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
