OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FRemaining largely settled over the
OL,7,Fcoming days with plenty of sunshine.
OL,8,FVery warm, with temperatures rising
OL,9,Ffurther and becoming hot locally by
OL,10,FWednesday. Cooler and less settled
OL,11,Ffrom Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
